You notice the small things others do not notice, allowing you to "see" creatures in a [5, 6, 7, 8, 9 (TL1-5)] radius even outside of light radius.

This is not telepathy, however, and it is still limited to line of sight.

Also, your attention to detail increases stealth detection and invisibility detection by [44, 58, 67, 74, 80 (TL1-5; CUN 100)], and you gain the ability to detect traps ([+38, +52, +61, +68, +75 (TL1-5; CUN 100)] detect 'power').

The detection abilities improve with Cunning.
